        "original_id": "39eabbcd-d591-52b3-8a2f-48b8a200ef1c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harold Ramis, Bill Murray, Andie MacDowell, Chris Elliott, Jennifer Celotta, Marita Geraghty\n- Works: Groundhog Day, Caddyshack, National Lampoon's Vacation, Analyze This, A Benihana Christmas\n- Roles: actor, director, writer, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Harold Ramis was an American actor, director, writer, and comedian who lived from November 21, 1944, to February 24, 2014.\n- Harold Ramis directed the comedy film Caddyshack, which was released in 1980.\n- Harold Ramis directed the comedy film National Lampoon's Vacation, which was released in 1983.\n- Harold Ramis directed the 1993 American fantasy-comedy film Groundhog Day.\n- Groundhog Day starred Bill Murray, Andie MacDowell, and Chris Elliott.\n- Marita Geraghty played Nancy Taylor in Groundhog Day.\n- Harold Ramis directed the episode A Benihana Christmas, which was written by Jennifer Celotta.\n- Harold Ramis directed the comedy film Analyze This, which was released in 1999.",
